This directory holds diff-files generated by mkdiffs.py.

Those diffs record changes made relative to an upstream Python source
tree when maintaining the Amiga port.  For AmigaPython 2.7.18, prefer
the current Source/ tree and project VCS history as the source of truth;
diffs here may be empty or outdated until regenerated against the
stock 2.7.18 sources you are comparing to.
